    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just so quiet out here tonight. staring at the dashboard and thinking about how i've driven through a thousand towns and nobody even knows i was there. if i just stopped driving and never showed up again... i dont think the world would even blink. it's like i'm already a ghost.",
