    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "fragile... yeah i guess. but it's more than that. it just feels like there's no weight to anything i do. i spend my whole life moving from one empty place to another and i feel like i'm just taking up space. if i wasn't here, it wouldn't disrupt anything. it wouldn't even be a disruption. it would just be... quiet. like it's supposed to be.",
